asset('A05','Workspace: empty / unconfigured / loading / lookup error / success / unknown / no match / unavailable','Make the next action clear without implying evidence that is absent.','interface-first','MUST','IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIRED',['design/phase16/workspace.html','web/scripts/phase16-target-qa.mjs'],'Semantic text, CSS indicator, existing controls; no illustration set','390×844, 768px, 1440×900; status and action stay in reading order. No fixed screenshot embedded as application state.','Plain status text and available next action. Loading can use static wording.','Keep all eight states distinct. Success does not suggest failure repair. Unknown requires investigation. No-match differs from unavailable. Clear stale results. Indicators obey reduced motion.','State-specific text in the interface; do not add redundant decorative alt text.','evidence/phase16/workspace-unavailable-mobile.png')
asset('A06','Protected review / pending / completed receipt','Show what the human approved and whether storage actually completed.','interface-first','MUST','IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIRED',['design/phase16/workspace.html','evidence/real-case/human-approval.json','evidence/real-case/reviewed-memory-receipt.json'],'Actual form/status/receipt DOM; controlled-state QA captures','Desktop and mobile. Do not crop proof-method fields, confirmation or completion identity. Pending is a separate state with job recovery.','Readable status plus job identifier; completed receipt only after confirmed job. No image-only receipt.','Keep both confirmation methods and conditional fields. No prechecked approval; no resubmit-as-recovery. Existing receipt may be read for captures; a new case requires its own approval. Controlled fixtures labelled in QA.','Human review fields followed by a storage receipt; completion names the retained blob.','evidence/phase16/workspace-receipt-mobile.png')
